{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00812","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 雍煕舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 雍煕舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁君御宇，寰海谧清。\n运符武德，道协文明。\n九成式敍，百度惟贞。\n金门积庆，玉叶传荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}